# RAMQuick ignore rules.
# Only build output, tool state and local run data are ignored. Source, project files, props,
# manifests, publish profiles, JSON, scripts and the packages.lock.json files are always tracked:
# deliberately, no pattern here matches *.props, *.pubxml, *.manifest, *.json or *.ps1.

# --- Repository build artefacts ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Directory.Build.props roots native output at artifacts/bin/native/ and native intermediates at
# artifacts/obj/native/. Publish output (artifacts/publish/RamQuick-win-x64/ and its zip), test
# results (artifacts/test-results/) and coverage reports (artifacts/coverage/) live here as well.
/artifacts/

# --- .NET build output ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Managed projects keep their output in their own bin/ and obj/ folders.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.binlog

# --- vcpkg manifest installs ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Restored from the root vcpkg.json into /vcpkg_installed/. The pattern is unanchored so it also
# matches at any depth, in case a project overrides VcpkgManifestRoot.
vcpkg_installed/

# --- MSVC default intermediates ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only produced when a native project is built outside src/engine/engine.props.
[Xx]64/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
ipch/
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.idb
*.pch
*.ipch
*.exp
# No static library is committed; engine_core.lib is built.
*.lib
# No binary is committed; ramquick_engine.dll and ramquick_engine_test.dll are built.
*.dll

# --- Visual Studio and editor state --------------------------------------------------------------
# No editor settings are part of the product.
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.aps
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- Test output ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.cobertura.xml
coverage/

# --- NuGet ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.nupkg
.nuget/

# --- Local run data ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The progress journal and results logs a developer run writes to <exe folder>\data. Only these
# two subfolders are matched, so no source folder named "data" can ever be hidden.
**/data/journal/
**/data/logs/

# --- Operating-system files ----------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Always tracked ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kept last so they override every pattern above.
# Restore generates each project's packages.lock.json; they are committed to freeze every
# transitive package version.
!**/packages.lock.json
# Synthesised SMBIOS tables are committed test data. No *.bin pattern exists; this is a guard.
!tests/RamQuick.Sensors.Tests/Fixtures/*.bin
